  "x-finaudit-integer-semantics": "All Event integer fields are mathematical integers in the I-JSON interoperable range 0..9007199254740991; safePositiveInteger additionally rejects zero. Raw JSON number-token spelling is not an Event fact and is neither preserved nor validated. DTO construction rejects booleans and numeric strings; DTO and RFC 8785 JCS serialization emit the canonical non-negative integer form 0|[1-9][0-9]*.",
  "x-finaudit-hash-projections": {
    "input_hash": "lowercase SHA-256 of the exact RFC 8785 JCS request-body bytes sent to the Provider; Authorization, traceparent, and every other header are excluded",
    "output_hash": "lowercase SHA-256 of the exact decompressed response-body bytes, only after the full body is read and passes the applicable byte gate; the digest does not imply business-Schema or citation success",
    "prompt_hash": "lowercase SHA-256 of RFC 8785 JCS over {prompt_id,prompt_version,schema_sha256,schema_version,system_template_sha256,user_template_sha256}; source templates are UTF-8 without BOM, use LF, and are not Unicode-normalized"
  },
  "x-finaudit-projection-notes": [
    "Hash preimages may contain sensitive business content in memory, but only the digest is emitted or persisted.",
    "The sink maps logical_generation_no, provider_attempt_no, status, citation_validation_status, completed_at, safe_error_code, and http_status directly to Request ai_call_logs names.",
    "Before persistence, positive integer policy_version is converted to its no-leading-zero decimal string for Request ai_call_logs.policy_version VARCHAR(80).",
    "Started fields insert the ai_call_logs row; sequence 2 changes only approved terminal columns; sequence 3 never overwrites ai_call_logs."
  ]
}
